  "releaseNotes": "RoomSharp 0.4.3\n            - Migration engine overhaul: strict pathing, transaction-bound execution, journaling, dirty-state protection, and cross-process provider locks.\n            - Concurrency overhaul: Serialized (default) and Parallel (opt-in) execution with connection-per-operation sessions and Unit-of-Work support.\n            - Mapper cache moved to runtime (RoomDatabase-owned) to reduce generated code size while preserving an allocation-free hit path.\n            - New packages: RoomSharp.Cli (scaffolding, migrations, schema, queries), RoomSharp.QueryExtensions (high-performance raw SQL helpers), and RoomSharp.Reactive (transaction-aware reactive queries).\n            - MySQL provider switched internally from MySql.Data to MySqlConnector (no application-level changes required).\n            - Breaking change: QueryExecutor and [RawQuery] removed; migrate to RoomSharp.QueryExtensions.",
